### Add a log manually (optional test)
POST http://192.168.1.22:5000/api/logs/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "test",
  "message": "Manual log entry from VS Code"
}

### Get all logs
GET http://192.168.1.22:5000/api/logs

### Get logs by date
GET http://192.168.1.22:5000/api/logs/2026-05-08
